="00:34.370" end="00:35.122">door </span><span begin="00:35.122" end="00:35.370">on </span><span begin="00:35.370" end="00:35.602">your </span><span begin="00:35.602" end="00:35.922">way </span><span begin="00:35.922" end="00:36.098">to </span><span begin="00:36.098" end="00:36.354">the </span><span begin="00:36.354" end="00:37.092">sky</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.730" end="00:42.683"><span begin="00:39.730" end="00:39.937">You </span><span begin="00:39.937" end="00:40.180">look </span><span begin="00:40.180" end="00:40.611">pretty </span><span begin="00:40.611" end="00:41.139">good </span><span begin="00:41.139" end="00:41.610">down </span><span begin="00:41.610" end="00:42.683">here</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.386" end="00:45.250"><span begin="00:43.386" end="00:43.586">But </span><span begin="00:43.586" end="00:43.796">you </span><span begin="00:43.796" end="00:44.043">ain't </span><span begin="00:44.043" end="00:44.586">really </span><span begin="00:44.586" end="00:45.250">good</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.842" end="00:51.770"><span begin="00:48.842" end="00:49.098">We </span><span begin="00:49.098" end="00:49.522">never </span><span begin="00:49.522" end="00:50.042">learn </span><span begin="00:50.042" end="00:50.273">we </span><span begin="00:50.273" end="00:50.572">been </span><span begin="00:50.572" end="00:51.018">here </span><span begin="00:51.018" end="00:51.770">before</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.817" end="00:55.821"><span begin="00:52.817" end="00:53.033">Why </span><span begin="00:53.033" end="00:53.282">are </span><span begin="00:53.282" end="00:53.570">we </span><span begin="00:53.570" end="00:54.050">always </span><span begin="00:54.050" end="00:54.298">stuck </span><span begin="00:54.298" end="00:54.594">and </span><span begin="00:54.594" end="00:55.074">running </span><span begin="00:55.074" end="00:55.821">from</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.218" end="00:57.465"><span begin="00:56.218" 